{"id": "msg_76c7bc3d9cf745fca6f8e060d6445867", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "comment 文件写好。运行脚本生成 8 条事务调用模板。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac03a3199b08921e", "tool_name": "ops_bash", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "cd \"D:\\repository\\skills\\zentao-analyzer\" && node zentao-resolve.mjs 7052 --comment-file \"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\zentao-7052\\comment.html\" --attach \"24777:png\"", "description": "生成禅道回写事务调用模板"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T03:49:53.067Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-kunshan-wuguan-fe-zhi1-mobile-shimin-h5-zhishu-c-unlimited"}
{"id": "msg_9947d1dd88444b9ab864806ec4114624", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac03a3199b08921e", "tool_name": "ops_bash", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[cwd: resolvedFrom=\"D:\\\\repository\\\\昆山市民\"; cwdSource=\"workingDirectory\"]\n# zt_bug 7052 回写序列（connection_name=新禅道，每步必带）\n\n## 1) 查现状（拿 product/project/execution/openedBy）\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_execute_query\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"sql\": \"SELECT id,status,assignedTo,openedBy,product,project,execution,resolution FROM zt_bug WHERE id=7052;\"\n  }\n}\n核验: 记录 openedBy（回写 assignedTo 用）与 product/project/execution 原值\n\n## 2) 开事务 session\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_open_session\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"enable_transactions\": true\n  }\n}\n核验: 取返回的 session_id，后续所有事务内调用都带它 + connection_name\n\n## 3) begin\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_begin_transaction\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: 成功后再执行第 4/5 步\n\n## 4) UPDATE zt_bug → resolved\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_execute_query\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"sql\": \"UPDATE zt_bug SET status='resolved', resolution='fixed', resolvedBuild='trunk', resolvedBy='tiany', resolvedDate=NOW(), assignedTo='<openedBy>', lastEditedBy='tiany', lastEditedDate=NOW() WHERE id=7052;\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: affected rows = 1\n\n## 5) INSERT zt_action（14 列，files 挂附件 id 列表或 NULL）\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_execute_query\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"sql\": \"INSERT INTO zt_action (objectType,objectID,product,project,execution,actor,action,date,comment,files,extra,`read`,efforted,vision) VALUES ('bug',7052,'<product>','<project>','<execution>','tiany','resolved',NOW(),'<p><b>【修复完成】C端房屋核查申请无法上传图片</b></p>\\n<p><b>根因：</b>图片上传组件 ImageUploader 的 v-model 事件名写成 <code>update:value</code>，与父组件 <code>v-model</code> 预期的 <code>update:modelValue</code> 不一致，上传成功后无法回写图片 URL；且删除时直接对 props 数组 splice（违规修改 props）；两处 uni.showToast 传字符串在触发路径上引发 InvalidCharacterError；ZsImage 使用 :onload/:onerror 而非 Vue 事件监听。上述共同导致上传图片失败并报错。</p>\\n<p><b>修复：</b></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>ImageUploader.vue：emit 改为 <code>update:modelValue</code>（3 处）；删除改为 <code>props.modelValue.filter()</code> 新数组；上传成功用 <code>[...props.modelValue]</code> 后 push；两处 toast 改对象形式 <code>{title, icon:''none''}</code>。</li>\\n<li>ZsImage.vue：<code>:onload/:onerror</code> 改为 <code>@load/@error</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><b>验证：</b>npm run build 通过（exit 0）；agent-browser 实机验证四类分支（超大文件限制提示、正常上传渲染、删除图片、全程无 InvalidCharacterError）；上传接口真实调用已实测（非 mock 伪造响应）：浏览器发出真实 FormData 请求 <code>POST /api/estate/AppDecision/upload bodylen=2231</code> → 200 → 图片成功渲染。</p>\\n<p><b>提交：</b>fix(myhouse): 修复房屋核查申请图片上传失败与InvalidCharacterError报错（commit 1174fa6，已推送 origin/main）。</p>\\n<p><b>验证截图：</b></p>\\n<p><img src=\\\"/data/uploads/24777.png\\\" alt=\\\"上传修复实机验证截图\\\" /></p><p><img src=\\\"{24777.png}\\\" alt=\\\"index.php?m=file&amp;f=read&amp;t=png&amp;fileID=24777\\\" /></p>','24777','fixed',0,0,'rnd');\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: affected rows = 1；product/project/execution 用第 1 步查到的原值；files 为逗号分隔 fileID 或 NULL\n\n## 5b) 把上传的附件 zt_file 挂到 bug（comment 内嵌需要 objectType/objectID 正确）\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_execute_query\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"sql\": \"UPDATE zt_file SET objectType='bug',objectID=7052,addedBy='tiany',addedDate=NOW() WHERE id IN (24777);\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: affected rows = 附件数；objectType='bug' 且 objectID=7052\n\n## 6) 事务内复核\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_execute_query\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"sql\": \"SELECT status,resolution,resolvedBy,resolvedDate,assignedTo FROM zt_bug WHERE id=7052;\\nSELECT actor,action FROM zt_action WHERE objectType='bug' AND objectID=7052 ORDER BY id DESC;\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: status=resolved / resolution=fixed / resolvedBy / assignedTo 均符合预期\n\n## 7) commit\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_commit_transaction\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: 返回 committed 即成功；不再做无 session 的第二次复核\n\n## 8) 关 session\nmcp_gateway {\n  \"server\": \"dbx\",\n  \"tool\": \"dbx_close_session\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"connection_name\": \"新禅道\",\n    \"session_id\": \"<session_id>\"\n  }\n}\n核验: 结束\n\n\n[exit code: 0]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_9947d1dd88444b9ab864806ec4114624", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 4253, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-27T03:49:53.260Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-kunshan-wuguan-fe-zhi1-mobile-shimin-h5-zhishu-c-unlimited"}
